{"abstract":"A recent line of work lifts particular verification and analysis methods to Software Product Lines (SPL). In an effort to generalize such case-by-case approaches, we develop a systematic methodology for lifting program analyses to SPLs using abstract interpretation. Abstract interpretation is a classical framework for deriving static analyses in a compositional, step-by-step manner. We show how to take an analysis expressed as an abstract interpretation and lift each of the abstract interpretation steps to a family of programs. This includes schemes for how to lift domain types, and combinators for lifting analyses and Galois connections. We prove that for analyses developed using our method, the soundness of lifting follows by construction. Finally, we discuss approximating variability in an analysis and we derive variational data-flow equations for an example analysis, a constant propagation analysis for a simple imperative language.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Midtgaard, Jan","Brabrand, Claus","Wasowski, Andrzej"],"cuid":["S02-084.04-027177"],"event":{"end":"2014-04-25","place":"Lugano, ch","start":"2014-04-22","title":"International Conference on Modularity","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Abstract Interpretation","Software product lines","Static analysis","Verification"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"systematic derivation of static analyses for software product lines","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/74512903/TR_2014_170.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S02-084.04-027177","identifier":[{"id":"84900021591","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-c843ab67-bc94-4445-bd74-f580b1345948","itu-a492a6d7-e0c3-44cf-9c82-fc664cb54812"],"keyword":["Abstract Interpretation","Software product lines","Static Analysis","verification"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-209CDAA8D07A082527E8A87342D9E93C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2577091","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/74512903/TR_2014_170.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/2577080.2577091","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","The Department, Software & Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"midtgaardpau","last":"Midtgaard","locid":"bc81b2f8-5fda-47b6-b465-49732e3919a5","name":"Midtgaard, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Claus","key":"brabrandpau","last":"Brabrand","locid":"47a94200-3abe-4354-b5e3-c8ef6f1ba1f2","name":"Brabrand, Claus","orcid":"0000-0001-5093-5806","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrzej","key":"wasowskip